<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Legg Mason cuts A.O. Smith.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Legg Mason cuts A.O. Smith.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Legg Mason auto parts stock analyst Scott Soffen said he cut his rating on A.O. Smith to market perform from buy, due to valuation concerns.</p>
<p>-- Soffen said the downgrade was &quot;based solely on the stock's recent rates of appreciation.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock was trading at 29-7/8, down 1-7/8 Monday morning.</p>
<p>-- The analyst said he had previously held a price target of $34 on the stock.</p>
</text>
